flowchart TB
  accTitle: Clone transfer and share create different ownership relationships
  accDescr: Clone produces independent receiver bytes. Transfer moves a dedicated ArrayBuffer and detaches every sender view. SharedArrayBuffer permits both threads to access the same region with an explicit synchronization protocol.
C["Clone ordinary bytes"] --> C1["Sender: original usable
Receiver: independent copy"]
  C1 ~~~ T["Transfer dedicated
ArrayBuffer"]
  T --> T1["Receiver owns storage
All sender views detached"]
  T1 ~~~ S["Share SharedArrayBuffer"]
  S --> S1["Both access same region
Coordinate with Atomics"]
  class C,T,S control;
  class C1 success;
  class T1,S1 pending;

